{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"ninja","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Ninja build","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Ninja build (.ninja).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"ninja","name":"Ninja build","extensions":[".ninja"],"grammar":"grammars/ninja.json","filenames":["build.ninja"],"lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Ninja build","path":"snippets/ninja.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/ninja.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$\\\\{?[A-Za-z_][\\\\w.-]*\\\\}?|\\\\$[ :$]\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s+[a-z_]+(?=\\\\s*=)\",\n      \"token\": \"attribute\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\|\\\\|?|:\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:subninja|default|include|build|rule|pool)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/ninja.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Rule\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rule\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"rule ${1:cc}\",\n      \"  command = ${2:gcc -c $in -o $out}\",\n      \"  description = ${3:CC $out}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A rule\"\n  },\n  \"Build edge\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"build\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"build ${1:out.o}: ${2:cc} ${3:in.c}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A build statement\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Ninja build\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Ninja build.\n\n## Files\n\n`.ninja`, `build.ninja`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 2 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `rule` | A rule |\n| `build` | A build statement |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}